There's no success under XFree86 any release, as there's no driver
for it, and no likely to be; it's a proprietary chipset that DEC/COMPAQ
OEM's from elsewhere (Evans and Sutherland?), and therefore unlikely
to ever have a driver under XFree86.

Sorry.

